      "comment": "Papa Wrench: Fortunate One incident",
      "content": "Ten years before the quest, Mr. Shesternin Sr. disappeared on the ship Fortunate One, where Zhorik and Police Chief Stalanov were also passengers. Zhorik acted suspiciously but there was no hard evidence, so it was treated as an accident. The Tale-Telling Heart shows that Zhorik pushed him overboard to gain the Shesternin wealth.",
